# Normalise to LF in the repository AND in the working tree.
# `text=auto` alone lets core.autocrlf=true check files out as CRLF on Windows,
# which both `.editorconfig` (`end_of_line = lf`) and Prettier (`endOfLine: lf`)
# reject - so `npm run format:check` failed on every file for Windows clones.
* text=auto eol=lf
